close_reason: "Implementation, documentation, private live read-only acceptance, package/security gates, PM graph evidence, and PR #38 terminal review processing are complete; merge follows the generated closeout head."
plan_mode: completed
plan_scope: "OpenAPI operation resolution, safe generic API execution, agent tool contracts, setup/docs/help integration, behavior tests, live read-only acceptance, and release-ready PR closeout."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Jellyfin 10.11.11 exposes 429 operations across 356 paths; 397 leaf commands map fuzzily at score 3, but executable completeness needs exact operation validation. Implement jf api with read-only default and explicit mutation safeguards, then prove formats/help/live/package/quality and finish PR review."
plan_validation[3]{text,command,expected}:
  Exact operation behavior and formats pass against isolated server fixtures,bun test tests/utils/api-operation.test.ts tests/commands/api.test.ts,13 tests pass with no live mutation
  Compiled CLI passes the complete private live acceptance suite in enforced read-only mode,JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 JELLYFIN_E2E_USE_DIST=1 bun test tests/e2e/cli.test.ts,179 pass and zero fail without server mutations
  "Release, consumer, security, and changelog gates pass while legacy coverage and duplication gaps remain separately open","bun run validate:release",Exit 0 including portable test and npm/Bun tarball consumers
plan_decisions[2]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-24T21:00:02.347Z",codex-jellyfin-api,Add a generic exact-operation execution boundary as a fallback beneath the 397 typed commands.,Typed commands remain the intuitive primary UX; exact OpenAPI operation resolution provides complete forward-compatible access and turns discovery into executable evidence. Read-only methods are the safe default and mutations require an explicit flag plus remain subject to global read-only enforcement.,Official jellyfin/jellyfin v10.11.11 release and repository; live private schema census saved only under owner-only ~/.jellyfin-cli/research.
  "2026-07-24T21:40:16.456Z",codex-jellyfin-api,Buffer generic operation responses incrementally and cancel the response stream at the configured byte ceiling.,A post-arrayBuffer size check labels responses as bounded but cannot prevent excessive memory use; incremental enforcement makes the agent safety contract real.,Focused binary and overflow integration tests pass after streaming implementation.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:00:01.322Z",codex-jellyfin-api,"Configured Jellyfin 10.11.11 serves its OpenAPI document directly: 356 paths, 429 operations, 257 read-only operations, and 397 CLI leaf tools. At min_score=3 every operation has a semantic tool candidate, but one tool remains unmatched and fuzzy mapping is not executable coverage proof."
plan_steps[6]{id,order,title,status,created_at,updated_at,evidence,completed_at}:
  plan-step-001,1,Record official and live Jellyfin 10.11.11 operation evidence,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T21:11:03.786Z","Official jellyfin/jellyfin v10.11.11 and live owner-only research confirmed 356 paths, 429 uniquely identified operations, 257 read-only operations, 76 JSON body operations, 2 text bodies, and 4 image bodies; sanitized counts recorded in docs/api-research.md.","2026-07-24T21:11:03.786Z"
  plan-step-002,2,Implement exact OpenAPI operation resolution and safe API execution,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T21:37:54.508Z","Implemented exact case-insensitive operationId resolution, path/query/body contract validation, same-origin bounded response execution, JSON/text/file request bodies, strict content-type checks, read-only method routing, explicit mutation confirmation, and global read-only enforcement.","2026-07-24T21:37:54.508Z"
  plan-step-003,3,Integrate help tool schemas output formats and documentation,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T21:37:55.647Z","Registered api inspect/get/mutate with detailed nested help; added structured schemas and exact API tool filtering; documented README, docs index, API reference, agent integration, research, and release acceptance across TOON JSON YAML Markdown table and raw formats.","2026-07-24T21:37:55.647Z"
  plan-step-004,4,Add behavior-focused unit integration and live read-only acceptance tests,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T21:37:56.742Z","Behavior tests cover exact resolution, duplicate/unknown rejection, parameter/body/content-type validation, bounded JSON/text/base64 responses, all formatters, tool safety, and mock-only mutation. Final compiled live acceptance passed 179/179 read-only tests including exact inspect/get; no live mutation executed.","2026-07-24T21:37:56.742Z"
  plan-step-005,5,Run strict release quality security coverage duplication and PM gates,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T21:54:07.406Z","validate:release passed in full; 929 Bun tests pass with 179 live-only skips in portable mode, 920/920 Vitest portable tests pass, npm and isolated Bun tarball consumer smokes pass, file length/secrets/history/changelog gates pass, bun/npm audits and Trivy report zero findings. Honest repository baselines remain 38.65/38.31/50.27/38.32 four-metric coverage and 8.63% duplication, already canonically tracked by related jf-mkzh and jf-lpki; no threshold was weakened.","2026-07-24T21:37:58.238Z"
  plan-step-006,6,Publish PR process every bot finding merge and close PM lineage,completed,"2026-07-24T20:59:42.698Z","2026-07-24T22:03:23.484Z","PR #38 was rebased onto release head 5035805. Exact head 8e48399 passed Quality Gates, npm Compatibility, Secret Scanning, CodeQL actions and JavaScript analysis, semantic title, and commit-style checks. Complete thread-aware inventory found zero review threads or code findings; CodeRabbit and Sourcery were quota-limited, Gemini was sunset, Cubic was neutral, and Greptile produced no installed check or response after two exact-head requests. Every bot status comment/review was acknowledged and voted.","2026-07-24T22:03:23.484Z"
